+/* GCM_MEMTABLE=<hex ea>: dump the title's own mapping table (GoW Ascension's
+ * Ice::Render MemTable at 0x970F50: u32 count at +0x80, packed u32 entries from
+ * +4: bits 0-11 = key page, 12-20 = size pages, 21-29 = io page) at every map or
